      "f": "Anthony Naples 1990 年生，來自紐約；早期作品與美國興起的 outsider house 場景相關，近年轉向 ambient、techno、deep house 與更實驗的風格。",
      "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Naples"
     },
     {
      "f": "他自己經營 Incienso 廠牌；先前也經營過 Proibito，發行過 Huerco S 的名作《For Those Of You Who Have, and Also Those Of You Who Have Never》。",
